WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.130 --> 00:00:04.620
I'm going to start today doing something that
maybe you will find surprising, which is I'm

00:00:04.620 --> 00:00:10.930
going to phrase something that the Trump administration
did, even if indirectly.

00:00:10.930 --> 00:00:17.039
The CDC is run by Donald Trump's selection,
doctor Robert Redfield.

00:00:17.039 --> 00:00:24.349
The CDC, under the guidance of Trump's pick,
put together a fantastic document about how

00:00:24.349 --> 00:00:26.589
to open the economy safely.

00:00:26.589 --> 00:00:32.800
Now, you might be wondering I don't know,
Dave, but I saw that guidance that Trump promoted.

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:34.760
It seems pretty stupid, actually.

00:00:34.760 --> 00:00:35.890
It doesn't seem that good.

00:00:35.890 --> 00:00:36.890
And you would be right.

00:00:36.890 --> 00:00:42.490
I'm talking about a document that was suppressed
by the Trump administration and has only seen

00:00:42.490 --> 00:00:44.480
the light of day because it's been leaked.

00:00:44.480 --> 00:00:48.130
This is a guide to re-opening that's been
in the works for weeks.

00:00:48.130 --> 00:00:54.370
It contains really good, specific, detailed
guidance for different types of businesses

00:00:54.370 --> 00:00:59.150
and organizations, restaurants versus churches
versus child care.

00:00:59.150 --> 00:01:00.210
It's detailed.

00:01:00.210 --> 00:01:06.820
It's put together by professionals and it
was done by an agency run by a Trump selected

00:01:06.820 --> 00:01:07.820
appointee.

00:01:07.820 --> 00:01:13.229
It's all fantastic, except that the documents
were covered up by the Trump administration

00:01:13.229 --> 00:01:17.179
to see that they never actually see the light
of day.

00:01:17.179 --> 00:01:22.320
This is almost as big a scandal as Trump's
bungling of the medical side.

00:01:22.320 --> 00:01:25.729
They have good guidance for how to reopen
the economy.

00:01:25.729 --> 00:01:27.369
This is what we've been looking for.

00:01:27.369 --> 00:01:33.770
Dr. Robert Redfield worked on this for weeks
at the CDC, showed it to doctors like Dr.

00:01:33.770 --> 00:01:35.590
Bourke's and Dr. Foushee.

00:01:35.590 --> 00:01:38.570
Redfield even approved it by email.

00:01:38.570 --> 00:01:41.770
But it was this appeared never to be seen.

00:01:41.770 --> 00:01:47.249
It's now been leaked to the Associated Press
by CDC staffers who did not have permission

00:01:47.249 --> 00:01:48.409
to publish it.

00:01:48.409 --> 00:01:50.930
They knew the right way to reopen.

00:01:50.930 --> 00:01:57.909
The CDC put hundreds, thousands of total hours
into this, and they're just ignoring it because

00:01:57.909 --> 00:01:59.509
the optics wouldn't be good.

00:01:59.509 --> 00:02:04.619
Now, by the way, not I don't want to get off
track, but even the guidelines that the Trump

00:02:04.619 --> 00:02:10.610
administration did put out about how to go
to Phase 1, almost all of the states that

00:02:10.610 --> 00:02:15.980
have reopened have not actually achieved the
guidelines that supposedly you need to achieve

00:02:15.980 --> 00:02:16.980
to go to Phase 1.

00:02:16.980 --> 00:02:18.530
That's a different story.

00:02:18.530 --> 00:02:23.090
The document that the CDC put together would
have saved lives.

00:02:23.090 --> 00:02:27.770
There are all sorts of businesses that want
guidance for how to open correctly.

00:02:27.770 --> 00:02:31.340
And the guidance is different in a restaurant
than it is in a church.

00:02:31.340 --> 00:02:38.980
So, for example, they had a guide with advice
for restaurants and it includes lists of exactly

00:02:38.980 --> 00:02:41.550
how bars should be cleaned.

00:02:41.550 --> 00:02:47.370
Pay special attention to food contact surfaces
and how bathrooms at restaurants and bars

00:02:47.370 --> 00:02:48.390
should be dealt with.

00:02:48.390 --> 00:02:50.760
It addresses the issue of physical menus.

00:02:50.760 --> 00:02:55.330
I've tweeted before the physical menu is a
cesspool of germs that should be eliminated

00:02:55.330 --> 00:02:56.330
altogether.

00:02:56.330 --> 00:03:00.410
It talks about continuing to use disposable
utensils, even for people who start to eat

00:03:00.410 --> 00:03:01.760
in the restaurants.

00:03:01.760 --> 00:03:05.400
This is really good stuff tailored specifically
for restaurants.

00:03:05.400 --> 00:03:07.580
But Trump just wants things wide open.

00:03:07.580 --> 00:03:10.450
So this guide was smothered and covered up.

00:03:10.450 --> 00:03:13.210
It has different guidance for churches.

00:03:13.210 --> 00:03:18.020
For example, actually tailored to churches,
for example.

00:03:18.020 --> 00:03:21.170
Everybody over age 2 should wear a mask at
church.

00:03:21.170 --> 00:03:22.170
Period.

00:03:22.170 --> 00:03:24.110
Trump doesn't want that getting out there.

00:03:24.110 --> 00:03:29.550
Put up signs all over the building, the church,
synagogue, mosque, whatever, so that people

00:03:29.550 --> 00:03:32.640
see the social distancing guidelines wherever
they look.

00:03:32.640 --> 00:03:38.010
It encourages video streaming or drive in
services, suspend a choir.

00:03:38.010 --> 00:03:42.290
If your a community of faith has one because
people standing near each other singing is

00:03:42.290 --> 00:03:44.350
a great way to spread droplets.

00:03:44.350 --> 00:03:46.670
Singing spreads the more than talking.

00:03:46.670 --> 00:03:51.530
These are really good specific rock recommendations
and it all went in the trash.

00:03:51.530 --> 00:03:54.760
Now one other note, which is the cover up.

00:03:54.760 --> 00:04:00.840
Trump's press secretary, Kelly McInerney or
McKenny said Friday that these guidelines

00:04:00.840 --> 00:04:05.070
