00:04:18.970 --> 00:04:20.900
it over so that we can publish it.

00:04:20.900 --> 00:04:22.540
The CDC was good to go.

00:04:22.540 --> 00:04:26.660
They had approved it and they were just waiting
for the Trump administration to give them

00:04:26.660 --> 00:04:28.710
